# Phase 3: System Health Monitoring Probe

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Readiness Gate**: The health probe endpoint must be implemented and verified before proceeding to core runtime foundations and page/component development.

---

## Deliverables & Tasks

- [ ] **3.1 System Health Monitoring Endpoint (`/api/health`)**
  - [ ] Implement `app/api/health/route.ts` checking:
    - V8 Heap memory saturation & usage
    - Event loop delay / lag
    - Node.js runtime process uptime
    - Optional downstream dependency checks (database, cache, upstream APIs)
  - [ ] Configure Docker container liveness & readiness probes against `/api/health`
  - [ ] Document monitoring contract in `docs/operations/health-and-telemetry.md`
- [ ] **3.2 Health Probe Verification**
  - [ ] Execute automated curl / HTTP test against `/api/health` ensuring `200 OK` JSON response
